sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant A as API SubmitService
    participant D as Postgres
    participant U as AuditChain
    participant W as Worker JobService
    participant S as ContentStore
    C->>A: POST documents with tenant and idempotency key
    A->>D: validate tenant and fields plus encode CBOR
    A->>D: fast-path findExisting by tenant and key
    alt duplicate key
        D-->>A: existing doc version job IDs
        A-->>C: 202 replay same IDs
    else new submit
        A->>D: BEGIN plus SET LOCAL app tenant
        A->>D: INSERT documents
        A->>D: INSERT document_versions sha CBOR
        A->>D: INSERT jobs QUEUED
        A->>D: INSERT outbox job committed
        A->>U: append submit seq 0 GENESIS
        U->>D: INSERT audit_events submit
        D-->>A: COMMIT doc version job IDs
        A-->>C: 202 new IDs
    end
    W->>D: claimNext ranks tenants under quota by penalty then next_run_at
    W->>D: claim takes tenant lock, rechecks quota, QUEUED due LIMIT 20 SKIP LOCKED
    D-->>W: RUNNING job plus token attempt lease
    W->>U: append claim RUNNING
    U->>D: INSERT audit_events claim
    W->>D: issueCap epoch 1 TTL 1h FOR UPDATE
    W->>U: append cap issue epoch
    U->>D: INSERT audit_events cap issue
    W->>S: putForJob plus linkArtifactToJob
    S->>D: upsert artifacts plus append cas put
    W->>D: commit with timeline check then cap check FOR UPDATE
    alt timeline unknown or rewound by a restore
        D-->>W: 503 TIMELINE UNCONFIRMED zero rows
    else cap invalid or revoked or expired
        D-->>W: 403 NEEDS APPROVAL zero rows
    else cap valid plus fence match
        D->>D: UPDATE jobs SUCCEEDED or FAILED
        W->>U: append commit outcome
        U->>D: INSERT audit_events commit
        D-->>W: commit true
    else fence mismatch zombie
        D-->>W: false zero rows no audit
    end
